{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04254","headline":"望月有所思 · 骆宾王","name":"望月有所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九秋凉风肃，千里月华开。\n圆光随露湛，碎影逐波来。\n似霜明玉砌，如镜写珠胎。\n晚色依关近，边声杂吹哀。\n离居分照耀，怨绪共裴徊。\n自绕南飞羽，空忝北堂才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}